    {
      "ic": "🏔️",
      "ms": "Altitud tinggi: Siguniang sekitar 3,000m+, dan kawasan lembah boleh lebih tinggi. Jalan perlahan, minum air banyak, jangan terlalu penat. Kalau sakit kepala teruk, muntah atau sesak nafas, turun ke tempat rendah dan dapatkan bantuan.",
      "en": "High altitude: Siguniang is around 3,000m+, and the valleys can go higher. Walk slowly, drink plenty of water and don't overexert. If you get a severe headache, vomiting or shortness of breath, go lower and get help.",
      "id": "r1"
    },
    {
      "ic": "❄️",
      "ms": "Sejuk dan bersalji: suhu boleh jatuh jauh bawah 0°C di gunung. Bawa thermal, jaket tebal, sarung tangan kalis air dan kasut yang tak licin.",
      "en": "Cold and snowy: mountain temperatures can drop well below 0°C. Bring thermals, a thick jacket, waterproof gloves and non-slip shoes.",
